<h2 class=3D"wp-block-heading">Halloumi curry</h2>



<p>To make this easy lentil and halloumi curry, start by frying up some veg=
etables. I used an onion, some courgette (zucchini), and some mushrooms. Fe=
el free to add whatever vegetables you have in the fridge =E2=80=93 curry i=
s such a great <a href=3D"https://www.easycheesyvegetarian.com/vegetarian-f=
ridge-clearing-ideas/">fridge-clearer</a>.</p><div id=3D"AdThrive_Content_2=
_desktop" class=3D"adthrive-ad adthrive-sticky-container adthrive-content a=
dthrive-content-2"></div>



<p>Then, add the diced halloumi. The cheese will release some liquid as it=
=E2=80=99s heated, so keep stirring until that=E2=80=99s cooked off.</p>



<p>Ideally, you want to get a little bit of colour on your halloumi and veg=
gies =E2=80=93 just a nice touch of caramelisation. It will make your curry=
 extra tasty.</p>



