<h2 class=3D"wp-block-heading">Simple spices</h2>



<p>You=E2=80=99ll also want to add a few spices to give your curry that all=
-important flavour. I used garam masala, which is already a blend of severa=
l different spices, so it=E2=80=99s great for non-experts like me who want =
somebody else to do most of the work.</p>



<p>I also added a bit more cumin (because why not?), and some smoked paprik=
a because I=E2=80=99m obsessed with it.</p>



<p>You could really spice this <a href=3D"https://www.easycheesyvegetarian.=
com/easy-falafel-curry/">vegetarian curry</a> however you like =E2=80=93 fe=
el free to change up the spices if you have a favourite blend!</p><div id=
=3D"AdThrive_Content_5_desktop" class=3D"adthrive-ad adthrive-sticky-contai=
ner adthrive-content adthrive-content-5"></div>



<p>Just put a lid on the pan, and let it all bubble away until the lentils =
are fully cooked and it=E2=80=99s as saucy as you want it.</p>



