=3D"async" width=3D"1200" height=3D"1800" data-pin-url=3D"https://www.easyc=
heesyvegetarian.com/lentil-halloumi-curry/?tp_image_id=3D13592" data-pin-ti=
tle=3D"Easy Lentil and Halloumi Curry" data-pin-description=3D"Lentil and h=
alloumi curry - this is really straightforward to make, and absolutely full=
 of flavour. Halloumi curry is a revelation! #halloumi #vegetariancurry #le=
